id=bcm_bt_fix
name=Samsung BCM4375 Bluetooth Fix
version=v3.4
versionCode=7
author=Antigravity
description=Fixes Bluetooth crashes, Watch/Buds disconnections, and pairing failures on Galaxy S20 Ultra by neutralizing all 12 kill() suicides (HCI timeout & connection timeout), bypassing LE_ADV_FILTER assert failures (0xFD57), suppressing vlog FATAL aborts, disabling buggy BCM4375 LE Extended Advertising (enforcing stable Legacy Advertising), skipping unsupported LE_ENERGY_INFO, and disabling DSP offload.
